# Umbraco
# website: https://umbraco.com
# docs: https://docs.umbraco.com
# description: ASP.NET and .NET Core Umbraco CMS ignore rules for backoffice assets, temporary cache, logs, models, and data.

# Umbraco generated folders
**/App_Data/Logs/
**/App_Data/[Pp]review/
**/App_Data/TEMP/
**/App_Data/NuGetBackup/

# Umbraco content cache file
**/App_Data/umbraco.config

# Umbraco packages whitelist
!**/App_Data/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Uu]mbraco/[Dd]eveloper/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Uu]mbraco/[Vv]iews/[Pp]ackages/*

# ImageProcessor DiskCache
**/App_Data/cache/

# Models Builder out of date flag
**/ood.flag

# Umbraco backoffice assets from wwwroot (v9+ .NET Core)
**/wwwroot/umbraco/

# SQLite files
*.sqlite.db*

# Umbraco data/views/settings
**/umbraco/*

# ModelsBuilder output whitelist
!**/umbraco/models

# Umbraco package data whitelist
!**/umbraco/Data/
**/umbraco/Data/*
!**/umbraco/Data/packages
!**/umbraco/Data/packages/*